# Classroom Context

#### This is the 6th, and final, unit of the course, building off the content from the previous units. 

#### Teachers serve as guides supporting **design thinking, encouraging responsible AI use, and helping students navigate through a capstone project**.

<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; border: 2px solid black; border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px 10px; margin: 20px 0;">

    
